    {
      "id": "text-43",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 912.0,
      "y": 130,
      "width": 236.0,
      "height": 275.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Synchronous, in-process gate\n-- not a subscriber to a\n'kill' event.\n\nTrips on:\n- Max daily loss breached\n- Max drawdown breached\n- Anomalous fill/slippage\n  pattern\n- Manual operator trigger\n- News Guard blackout\n  (see news-guard skill)\n\nWhen tripped: blocks ALL\nnew Approved Trades\nplatform-wide until manually\ncleared. Does not close\nexisting positions --\nthat is a separate,\nexplicit operator action.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Synchronous, in-process gate\n-- not a subscriber to a\n'kill' event.\n\nTrips on:\n- Max daily loss breached\n- Max drawdown breached\n- Anomalous fill/slippage\n  pattern\n- Manual operator trigger\n- News Guard blackout\n  (see news-guard skill)\n\nWhen tripped: blocks ALL\nnew Approved Trades\nplatform-wide until manually\ncleared. Does not close\nexisting positions --\nthat is a separate,\nexplicit operator action.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
